# Milestone: M3
# Covers: stats() returns cycle-count dictionary; resetStats() resets the cycle
#         counter to 1; resetStats() | stats().isNil() shows nil during reset.
# blocked: requires stats() / resetStats() stdlib functions (not implemented)
# matrix-row: stdlib-system
#
# Reason:
#   stats() and resetStats() are System-namespace helpers scheduled for M4.
#   The underlying determinism counter (urbi_get_determinism_checksum) is
#   implemented at M3 as a C API diagnostic but is not exposed to the urbiscript
#   layer as stats()/resetStats() until the System stdlib lands in M4.
#
# Original urbiscript (activate at M4 with System.stats/resetStats):
# # import System.*;
# # stats()["cycles"] > 1;
# # [00000001] true
# # resetStats(); stats()["cycles"];
# # [00000002] 1
# # resetStats() | stats().isNil();
# # [00000003] true
